WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.567
-Guys, I don't know
if you heard about this,

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.567
but I read that lately,
Amazon has been trying

00:00:03.567 --> 00:00:06.200
to crackdown on fake
product reviews.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.934
Well, luckily you can usually
tell when a review is fake.

00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:10.000
I'll show you what I mean.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.300
It's time for "Amazon reviews."

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.100
Here we go.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:18.067
-♪ Amazon Reviews ♪

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:19.901
-So, for each product,
I'm gonna show you

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:22.868
the fake review
and then the real review, okay?

00:00:22.868 --> 00:00:25.801
First up, here's
an avocado slicer.

00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:29.400
Fake review says, "The easiest
way to cut avocados."

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.200
The real review says,
"By the time I figured out

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.567
how the hell this works,
the avocado was brown."

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.634
-What?
-Holding it wrong?

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:39.033
-Cut it?
-"You hold it by the blade."

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.334
-"Squeeze the blade hard."
[Laughter]

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.767
-Next up, here's a Yeti tumbler.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:46.801
The fake review says,
"Keeps drinks cold for hours."

00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:49.200
Real review says, "This is why
your soccer mom friend

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.767
is slurring her words by the
second half of the game."

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.734
Here's a disposable
coverall suit.

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.701
Fake review says,
"I wear one of these

00:01:00.701 --> 00:01:02.501
any time I work with chemicals."

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:03.934
Real review says,
"I wear one of these

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:06.234
anytime I go to Florida."

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:08.300
-Really?
-That's what they said.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:12.868
Next up, here's a ring light
for shooting videos.

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:13.901
Yeah, the fake review says,

00:01:13.901 --> 00:01:16.100
"Makes my videos
look super professional."

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.267
The real review says,
"Makes it even more sad

00:01:18.267 --> 00:01:21.300
that my TikTok only got
six views."

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.734
Took me an hour.
-Aw!

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:24.767
It looked great.

00:01:24.767 --> 00:01:26.601
-It took me two hours
to do that.

00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:30.067
Next up, here's a set
of dog boots.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:33.267
Fake review says, "My dog loves
wearing these on the beach."

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:35.334
Real review says,
"I tried putting these on my dog

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:38.100
and he somehow gave me
the middle finger with his paw."

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.400
-Wow.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.534
-I don't know.

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:45.901
-Next up, here's a taco
sleeping bag.

00:01:45.901 --> 00:01:48.334
Fake review says,
"Comfortable and fun."

00:01:48.334 --> 00:01:50.601
Real review sats, "It breaks
the second you fold it.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.801
Should've gotten
the soft shell."

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:54.501
And that's --
-Now you know.

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:56.467
All right, now, next up,

00:01:56.467 --> 00:02:00.167
here's a Potty Putter
Toilet Time Golf Game.

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:02.534
[Laughter]
The fake review says,

00:02:02.534 --> 00:02:05.434
"This was a perfect
Father's day gift."

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:07.334
Real review says, "I love
playing golf on this,

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.033
but my caddies keep quitting."

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:12.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:13.100
-Yellow ball.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.767
-Next up, here's a Thanos
bathing suit.

00:02:15.767 --> 00:02:17.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:19.334
Fake review says,
"I love Marvel,

00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:21.267
so this was a great buy."

00:02:21.267 --> 00:02:23.567
Real review says, "I wish
I could snap my fingers

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:25.734
and make my kids unsee this."

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:33.067
And finally, here's a Wyze
smart scale.

00:02:33.067 --> 00:02:34.567
Fake review says,
"It's great to be able

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:36.868
to track my progress
on my phone."

00:02:36.868 --> 00:02:38.767
Real review says,
"Now I have two devices

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.133
that must be wrong."

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:42.300
That's all for "Amazon Reviews."

